                    <occupation>literary critic</occupation>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>This identification seems fairly straightforward - G usually specifies L or J Hunt, and for the 2-3 times he fails to do so it seems
reasonable to assume that it's Leigh Hunt as Leigh appears far more in the diary than John. Godwin also has 
two entries to Henry 'Orator' Hunt (1773-1835), the radical politician who appears as '<persName key="08">H Hunt'</persName>. Although he only appears twice he is a significant enough figure to merit a code. </p>
                    </note>
